IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. HELLO.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-NAME  PIC X(20) VALUE "world".
01 WS-COUNT PIC 9(3)  VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    DISPLAY "Hello, " WS-NAME.
    ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT.
    ADD 4 TO WS-COUNT.
    DISPLAY "Count: " WS-COUNT.
    IF WS-COUNT = 5 THEN
        DISPLAY "Count is five"
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.
